s technical data like your device type, operating system, browser type, and unique device identifiers. We use Google Analytics and Vercel's analytics tools to gather aggregate usage statistics. Google Analytics 4, for example, does not log your IP address and only derives coarse geo-location (city, region, country) before discarding the IP. Vercel Web Analytics uses only anonymized data and does not use cookies. Vercel Speed Insights similarly collects only anonymous performance metrics (e.g. page load times, connection speed) and country-level information, without identifying individual users."]}),(0,o.jsxs)("p",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Cookies and Tracking:"})," We use cookies and similar technologies to improve the Service. Cookies may store a unique identifier and remember your preferences. See the Cookies and Tracking section below for details."]}),(0,o.jsxs)("p",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Advertising and Measurement Data:"}),' If you consent to marketing cookies, we load advertising measurement tags ("pixels") from our advertising partners: Google (Google Ads), Meta Platforms (Facebook and Instagram), TikTok and OpenAI (ChatGPT advertising). These partners set cookies on your device (for example Meta\'s ',(0,o.jsx)("code",{children:"_fbp"})," and ",(0,o.jsx)("code",{children:"_fbc"}),", TikTok's ",(0,o.jsx)("code",{children:"_ttp"}),", and OpenAI's ",(0,o.jsx)("code",{children:"__oppref"})," and ",(0,o.jsx)("code",{children:"__obref"}),") and receive information about your visit: the pages you view, the actions you take on our site (such as viewing pricing, creating an account, or starting a trial), your IP address, your browser user agent, and the advertising click identifier that brought you to us (for example ",(0,o.jsx)("code",{children:"gclid"}),", ",(0,o.jsx)("code",{children:"fbclid"}),", ",(0,o.jsx)("code",{children:"ttclid"})," or ",(0,o.jsx)("code",{children:"oppref"}),")."]}),(0,o.jsx)("p",{children:'For the same purpose, and again only with your marketing consent, we send a matching copy of these conversion events to those partners from our own servers rather than from your browser. Those server-side copies can include your email address and your Postify account identifier in irreversibly hashed form (SHA-256), which lets a partner recognise a customer it already knows without us disclosing the address itself. Hashing reduces the risk but does not make the data anonymous, so we continue to treat it as Personal Data. We do not enable our advertising partners\' "automatic advanced matching" features, which would collect form fields we have not described here.'}),(0,o.jsxs)("p",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Advertising Audience Lists:"})," Separately from the tags above, we upload lists of customer and subscriber email addresses, again irreversibly hashed, to Google, Meta, LinkedIn, Pinterest and OpenAI on a recurring basis. We use these lists to exclude existing customers from advertising they do not need to see, to reach lapsed customers, and to help our partners find audiences similar to our customers. This upload happens on a schedule rather than in your browser, so it is not governed by the cookie banner: see Your Rights below for how to object to it, and Contact Us to have your address excluded."]})]})},{id:"how-we-use-information",title:"How We Use Your Information",content:(0,o.jsxs)(o.Fragment,{children:[(0,o.jsx)("p",{children:"We use your information only as necessary to provide, maintain, and improve the Service, including for the following purposes:"}),(0,o.jsxs)("ul",{className:"list-disc list-inside ml-4",children:[(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Service Provision:"})," To operate the Service and enable its features (e.g. posting to social media, scheduling, analytics dashboards)."]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Communication:"})," To contact you about your account, respond to support requests, and send 