t to it at any time."]})]}),(0,o.jsx)("p",{className:"mt-4",children:"Apart from the advertising partners named in this policy, and only in the ways described here, we do not share personal data with third parties for their own marketing. Our advertising partners act as independent controllers for some of this data and may use it in ways described in their own privacy policies. We do not sell or rent any Google user data under any circumstances, and we never disclose the content of your connected social media accounts to an advertising partner. We only disclose data as described below or as required by law."})]})},{id:"data-retention",title:"Data Retention",content:(0,o.jsx)(o.Fragment,{children:(0,o.jsx)("p",{children:"We retain your Personal Data only as long as needed for the purposes outlined above. We determine retention periods based on the nature of the data and legal requirements. For example, we keep billing and account records for financial and legal compliance. OAuth authentication data (including Google access tokens) are retained only as long as necessary to provide the Service and are automatically deleted when you disconnect your account or delete your Postify account. When personal data is no longer needed, we securely delete or anonymize it."})})},{id:"international-transfers",title:"International Data Transfers",content:(0,o.jsxs)(o.Fragment,{children:[(0,o.jsx)("p",{children:"Our servers and service providers may be located worldwide. If you are outside our home country, your Personal Data may be transferred to, stored, or processed in countries with different data protection laws."}),(0,o.jsx)("p",{children:"The recipients established in the United States currently include Google, Meta Platforms, TikTok, OpenAI, LinkedIn, Pinterest, Stripe, WorkOS, Vercel, Sentry and PostHog. For these transfers we rely on the European Commission's Standard Contractual Clauses, and, where the recipient is certified under it, on the EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework 