n privacy policy and, for some of this data, its own responsibilities as a controller."]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Consent Management:"})," Postify's own consent banner, which records your choice in the CookieConsent cookie on your device and keeps a consent receipt on our servers (see Cookies and Tracking). No third party is involved in asking you or in storing your answer."]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Authentication:"})," WorkOS, which handles sign-in and account security."]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Hosting and Infrastructure:"})," We rely on cloud hosting (such as Vercel's platform). These providers may collect system logs or crash reports."]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Payment Processors:"})," If you make payments through the Service, we use PCI-compliant processors (e.g. Stripe, Apple Pay) and do not store your payment card details. (These processors have their own privacy policies.)"]})]})]})},{id:"disclosure-of-data",title:"Disclosure of Your Data",content:(0,o.jsxs)(o.Fragment,{children:[(0,o.jsx)("p",{children:"We may share your Personal Data in the following situations:"}),(0,o.jsxs)("ul",{className:"list-disc list-inside ml-4",children:[(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Legal Compliance:"})," If required by law, regulation, or valid governmental request, we may disclose your data. We will respond to lawful requests by public authorities (e.g. court orders, subpoenas)."]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Protecting Rights:"})," We may share information if needed to protect our rights, property or safety, or the rights, property or safety of others. This includes enforcing our terms of use or preventing fraud."]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Business Transfers:"})," If our company is involved in a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets, your Personal Dat